{"id":"n69236-1-12","stage":5,"title":"용모 · 容貌","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69236-1-12-1","ko":"여기가 우리 아들인데 정말 잘생겼죠?","zh":"这是我们的儿子，长得真帅吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기가","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我，我们","explanation":"우리：我，我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"3","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아들인데","meaning":"儿子","explanation":"아들：儿子；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"아들","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20240","senseId":"1","lemma":"아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘생겼죠?","meaning":"好看，漂亮，英俊","explanation":"잘생기다：好看，漂亮，英俊；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"잘생기다","audio":"/audio/c56f4bd1fb4139c5b3d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24881","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我，我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"65e567305972e652","term":"아들","zh":"儿子","audio":"/audio/65e567305972e652430e.mp3","entryId":"20240","definition":"男性子女。","pronunciation":["아들"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"c56f4bd1fb4139c5","term":"잘생기다","zh":"好看，漂亮，英俊","audio":"/audio/c56f4bd1fb4139c5b3d2.mp3","entryId":"24881","definition":"人的容貌出众。","pronunciation":["잘생기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f451a46024588f3c9e2f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69236-1-12-2","ko":"네, 배우를 해도 될 정도로 용모가 출중하네요.","zh":"是啊，长得非常出众，当演员也完全没问题呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배우를","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해도","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정도로","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"1","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"용모가","meaning":"容貌","explanation":"용모：容貌；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"용모","audio":"/audio/1dfa55a1de55d0f573b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69236","senseId":"1","lemma":"용모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"출중하네요.","meaning":"出众，超群，杰出","explanation":"출중하다：出众，超群，杰出；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"출중하다","audio":"/audio/2754cd05eac7483427f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84094","senseId":"1","lemma":"출중하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"70129359d515b770","term":"배우","zh":"演员","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3","entryId":"58204","definition":"担任电影、话剧或电视剧等中的人物角色进行表演的人。","pronunciation":["배우"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"程度","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"表现事物的性质或价值好坏或多少的程度的分量或水准。","pronunciation":["정도"]},{"id":"1dfa55a1de55d0f5","term":"용모","zh":"容貌","audio":"/audio/1dfa55a1de55d0f573b9.mp3","entryId":"69236","definition":"人的面部模样。","pronunciation":["용모"]},{"id":"2754cd05eac74834","term":"출중하다","zh":"出众，超群，杰出","audio":"/audio/2754cd05eac7483427f0.mp3","entryId":"84094","definition":"在众人当中尤为突出。","pronunciation":["출쭝하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe54c93d6b20729c55b9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.182,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69236","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":152,"sequenceScore":3.0087,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是啊，长得非常出众，当演员也完全没问题呢。","这是我们的儿子，长得真帅吧？","最近在读什么书啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这是我们的儿子，长得真帅吧？","最近在读什么书啊？","是啊，长得非常出众，当演员也完全没问题呢。"],"answer":2}]}
